   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roads Rehabilitation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TIME SLICE OPERATION FOR THE CONSERVATION, REHABILITATION AND MAINTENANCE OF THE NATIONAL HIGHWAYS SYSTEM, IN ORDER TO DECREASE TRANSPORTATION TIME OF GOODS (MOSTLY AGRICULT. EXPORT PRODUCTS), AND REDUCE TRANSPORTATION COSTS. IT INCLUDES INVESTMENTS, INSTIT. STRENGHTHENING IN SUPPORT OF MAINTENANCE PRIVATIZATION ACTIVITIES AND FEASIBILITY STUDIES AND DESIGNS OF FUTURE PROJECTS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
